# integrations.icon_picker (src/app/icon_picker.zig): every Nerd Font
# glyph from the embedded catalog in the picker — the glyph, its human
# name, the category chip and the codepoint on the row, the nf- name
# and the \u{…} escape as the detail. Typing the canonical name finds
# the row (the detail is matched too); Enter copies the glyph and the
# toast says how to paste it either way.
command integrations.icon_picker
expect screen contains "Pick glyph (Enter copies it)"
expect screen contains "power  [iec]  U+23FB"
type cod-repo_pull
expect screen contains "▌  repo pull  [cod]  U+EB40"
expect screen contains "nf-cod-repo_pull"
key enter
expect screen lacks "Pick glyph"
expect screen contains "icon copied — paste:  or \u{EB40}"
